This is a hints, tips, and strategy guide to the Nintendo 64 video games Turok 2: Seeds of Evil, and The Legend of Zelda: Ocarina of Time {also called "Zelda 64"}. It features at several grey scale screenshots for the games, and has similar clip and paste artwork from the game. It covers the complete game of Turok 2, while only detailing the first few areas of Zelda 64. There are no maps of the levels, for either game. It is a free supplemental book, from the UK magazine "N64 Pro". These free supplemental books were sealed in a bag with the magazine, usually one each month. For a few issues they were replaced by other bonus gifts. {The book is also listed as being titled "Turok 2: The Complete Solution" on the copyright page, however this is different then the front cover's title, the spine simply calls it "Nintendo 64 Solutions" without the subtitle of the game's names.}

